# feat-ui-panel rebased onto main (patch 21 ring/bedside + patch 22 device event). Part 1: diag build (WEIXUE_FACE_DIAG=1), serial 185 s from an RTS reset at 04:30:49 UTC; say (UTC, volume 55): 04:32:01 "Jarvis", 04:32:07 "What time is it?", 04:32:25 "Jarvis", 04:32:30 "Goodbye". Panel open/close and card taps are the diag virtual-pointer replay at 40 s and 160 s. Device local time 21:30-21:34 (bedside hours 22:00-07:00). FACEDUMP lines removed; SSID/BSSID redacted.
